  "title": "Edit an automation (replace its flow)"
 },
 "description": "Edit an automation: change its triggers, messages or steps by replacing its whole document (there is no partial update). Read it first with get_automation and pass the version you got; a stale version is refused with version_conflict so a concurrent edit is not overwritten. Node types: send (mode window | private_reply | public_reply), condition, action, delay, random, goto, ai. Waiting is a send node with buttons and next: null; the tapped button's next continues. A loop must pass through such a wait. Validation problems come back with paths. Changing a live flow changes what goes out to people.",
